      "text": "[{\"id\":0,\"author\":\"user\",\"payload\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Build a mobile-first web app for generating phone wallpapers. Users describe their current desired vibe (e.g., \\\"rainy cyberpunk lo-fi\\\") and the app generates 4 variations in a 9:16 aspect ratio. Allow users to tap an image to see it full screen with \\\"Download\\\" and \\\"Remix\\\" buttons—remixing should use the current image as a reference for the next batch.\",\"files\":[\"{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Generate images with Nano Banana Pro\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"text/plain\\\",\\\"size\\\":247,\\\"lastModified\\\":1770128840535,\\\"data\\\":\\\"\u003d\u003d\\\"}\",\"{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Control image aspect ratios\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"text/plain\\\",\\\"size\\\":278,\\\"lastModified\\\":1770128840536,\\\"data\\\":\\\"\u003d\\\"}\"],\"fileUploads\":[],\"cMarkNode\":{}},\"createdTimestamp\":{\"seconds\":1770128840,\"nanos\":881000000}},{\"id\":1,\"author\":\"model\",\"payload\":{\"type\":\"thinking\",\"text\":\"**Defining the Core Focus**\\n\\nI\u0027m now zeroing in on defining the core focus: a mobile-first React web app for phone wallpapers. Gemini API (`gemini-3-pro-image-preview`) is the engine. The aesthetic direction is modern, sleek, and probably dark-mode-leaning or very clean.\\n\\n\\n**Refining the App Features**\\n\\nI\u0027m now detailing app features! I\u0027m planning prompts for vibe descriptions, resolutions (\\\"1K\\\", \\\"2K\\\", \\\"4K\\\"), and aspect ratios (\\\"1:1\\\" to \\\"21:9\\\"). Generation will yield four variations. Tap-to-fullscreen and download/remix functionality are also on the roadmap. I\u0027m also addressing the Gemini API key selection and requirement. I\u0027ve laid out the file structure: Entry point, app logic, core components, and API service. I have also begun defining core application state.\\n\\n\\n**Implementing API Logic**\\n\\nI\u0027m now implementing the API logic! I\u0027ve started on the API key check on app mount. I\u0027m focusing on `gemini-3-pro-image-preview` for both image generation and remixing. I\u0027ll be using `ai.models.generateContent` with a prompt. I also have base64 image data in the `contents.parts` along with the prompt. My plan is to loop and call the API four times in parallel (`Promise.all`) for image variations. I\u0027m optimizing for a mobile-first sticky bottom bar and image grid aesthetic. I am leaning towards deep dark blues/grays, and translucent buttons.\\n\\n\\n\",\"cMarkNode\":{}},\"createdTimestamp\":{\"seconds\":1770128840,\"nanos\":881000000},\"doneTimestamp\":{\"seconds\":1770128849,\"nanos\":746000000}},{\"id\":2,\"author\":\"model\",\"payload\":{\"type\":\"generationTable\",\"entries\":[{\"path\":\"metadata.json\",\"generationType\":0,\"isDone\":true,\"description\":\"Add application metadata with name and description.\",\"diffs\":[{\"target\":\"\",\"replacement\":\"\\n{\\n  \\\"name\\\": \\\"VibePaper - AI Wallpapers\\\",\\n  \\\"description\\\": \\\"Generate stunning, high-resolution phone wallpapers by describing your desired vibe. Tap to view full screen, remix, and download variations.\\\"\\n}\\n\"}]},{\"path\":\"index.html\",\"generationType\":0,\"isDone\":true,\"description\":\"The main HTML file including Tailwind CSS and root element.\",\"diffs\":[{\"target\":\"\",\"replacement\":\"\\n\u003c!DOCTYPE html\u003e\\n\u003chtml lang\u003d\\\"en\\\"\u003e\\n\u003chead\u003e\\n  \u003cmeta charset\u003d\\\"UTF-8\\\"\u003e\\n  \u003cmeta name\u003d\\\"viewport\\\" content\u003d\\\"width\u003ddevice-width, initial-scale\u003d1.0, maximum-scale\u003d1.0, user-scalable\u003dno\\\"\u003e\\n  \u003ctitle\u003eVibePaper - AI Wallpapers\u003c/title\u003e\\n  \u003cscript src\u003d\\\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\\\"\u003e\u003c/script\u003e\\n  \u003cstyle\u003e\\n    @import url(\u0027https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family\u003dInter:wght@300;400;500;600;700\u0026display\u003dswap\u0027);\\n    body {\\n      font-family: \u0027Inter\u0027, sans-serif;\\n      background-color: #0f172a;\\n      color: #f8fafc;\\n      margin: 0;\\n      padding: 0;\\n      -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\\n    }\\n    .glass {\\n      background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.7);\\n      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);\\n      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);\\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\\n    }\\n    .gradient-bg {\\n      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e293b 0%, #0f172a 100%);\\n    }\\n    /* Hide scrollbar for Chrome, Safari and Opera */\\n    .no-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar {\\n      display: none;\\n    }\\n    /* Hide scrollbar for IE, Edge and Firefox */\\n    .no-scrollbar {\\n      -ms-overflow-style: none;  /* IE and Edge */\\n      scrollbar-width: none;  /* Firefox */\\n    }\\n  \u003c/style\u003e\\n\u003c/head\u003e\\n\u003cbody class\u003d\\\"gradient-bg min-h-screen\\\"\u003e\\n  \u003cdiv id\u003d\\\"root\\\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\\n\u003c/body\u003e\\n\u003c/html\u003e\\n\"}]},{\"path\":\"index.tsx\",\"generationType\":0,\"isDone\":true,\"description\":\"Entry point for the React application.\",\"diffs\":[{\"target\":\"\",\"replacement\":\"\\nimport React from \u0027react\u0027;\\nimport ReactDOM from \u0027react-dom/client\u0027;\\nimport App from \u0027./App\u0027;\\n\\nconst rootElement \u003d document.getElementById(\u0027root\u0027);\\nif (!rootElement) {\\n  throw new Error(\\\"Could not find root element to mount to\\\");\\n}\\n\\nconst root \u003d ReactDOM.createRoot(rootElement);\\nroot.render(\\n  \u003cReact.StrictMode\u003e\\n    \u003cApp /\u003e\\n  \u003c/React.StrictMode\u003e\\n);\\n\"}]},{\"path\":\"types.ts\",\"generationType\":0,\"isDone\":true,\"description\":\"Global TypeScript interfaces and enums.\",\"diffs\":[{\"target\":\"\",\"replacement\":\"\\nexport type AspectRatio \u003d \u00271:1\u0027 | \u00272:3\u0027 | \u00273:2\u0027 | \u00273:4\u0027 | \u00274:3\u0027 | \u00279:16\u0027 | \u002716:9\u0027 | \u002721:9\u0027;\\nexport type ImageSize \u003d \u00271K\u0027 | \u00272K\u0027 | \u00274K\u0027;\\n\\nexport interface Wallpaper {\\n  id: string;\\n  url: string;\\n  prompt: string;\\n  aspectRatio: AspectRatio;\\n  resolution: ImageSize;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface GenerationState {\\n  isGenerating: boolean;\\n  error: string | null;\\n  currentProgress: number;\\n}\\n\"}]},{\"path\":\"services/geminiService.ts\",\"generationType\":0,\"isDone\":true,\"description\":\"Service logic for interacting with the Gemini API to generate images.\",\"diffs\":[{\"target\":\"\",\"replacement\":\"\\nimport { GoogleGenAI } from \\\"@google/genai\\\";\\nimport { AspectRatio, ImageSize } from \\\"../types\\\";\\n\\nexport const generateWallpapers \u003d async (\\n  prompt: string,\\n  aspectRatio: AspectRatio,\\n  imageSize: ImageSize,\\n  referenceImageBase64?: string\\n): Promise\u003cstring\u003e \u003d\u003e {\\n  const ai \u003d new GoogleGenAI({ apiKey: process.env.API_KEY });\\n  \\n  const contents: any \u003d {\\n    parts: [\\n      { text: prompt }\\n    ]\\n  };\\n\\n  if (referenceImageBase64) {\\n    // Clean base64 if it has prefix\\n    const data \u003d referenceImageBase64.replace(/^data:image\\\\/(png|jpeg|webp);base64,/, \\\"\\\");\\n    contents.parts.unshift({\\n      inlineData: {\\n        data: data,\\n        mimeType: \\\"image/png\\\"\\n      }\\n    });\\n    // Adjust prompt for remixing\\n    contents.parts[1].text \u003d `Remix this image with the following vibe: ${prompt}. Maintain the composition but apply new style.`;\\n  }\\n\\n  const response \u003d await ai.models.generateContent({\\n    model: \u0027gemini-3-pro-image-preview\u0027,\\n    contents: contents,\\n    config: {\\n      imageConfig: {\\n        aspectRatio,\\n        imageSize\\n      }\\n    }\\n  });\\n\\n  if (!response.candidates?.[0]?.content?.parts) {\\n    throw new Error(\\\"No image data returned from API\\\");\\n  }\\n\\n  for (const part of response.candidates[0].content.parts) {\\n    if (part.inlineData) {\\n      return `data:image/png;base64,${part.inlineData.data}`;\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  throw new Error(\\\"Could not find image in response parts\\\");\\n};\\n\"}]},{\"path\":\"App.tsx\",\"generationType\":0,\"isDone\":true,\"description\":\"Main application component handling routing/state for API key selection and the generator.\",\"diffs\":[{\"target\":\"\",\"replacement\":\"\\nimport React, { useState, useEffect } from \u0027react\u0027;\\nimport WallpaperApp from \u0027./components/WallpaperApp\u0027;\\n\\ndeclare global {\\n  interface Window {\\n    aistudio: {\\n      hasSelectedApiKey: () \u003d\u003e Promise\u003cboolean\u003e;\\n      openSelectKey: () \u003d\u003e Promise\u003cvoid\u003e;\\n    };\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nconst App: React.FC \u003d () \u003d\u003e {\\n  const [hasKey, setHasKey] \u003d useState\u003cboolean | null\u003e(null);\\n\\n  useEffect(() \u003d\u003e {\\n    const checkKey \u003d async () \u003d\u003e {\\n      try {\\n        const selected \u003d await window.aistudio.hasSelectedApiKey();\\n        setHasKey(selected);\\n      } catch (err) {\\n        setHasKey(false);\\n      }\\n    };\\n    checkKey();\\n  }, []);\\n\\n  const handleSelectKey \u003d async () \u003d\u003e {\\n    try {\\n      await window.aistudio.openSelectKey();\\n      // Assume success as per instructions\\n      setHasKey(true);\\n    } catch (err) {\\n      console.error(\\\"Failed to open key selector\\\", err);\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  if (hasKey \u003d\u003d\u003d null) return null;\\n\\n  if (!hasKey) {\\n    return (\\n      \u003cdiv className\u003d\\\"flex flex-col items-center justify-center min-h-screen p-6 text-center space-y-8\\\"\u003e\\n        \u003cdiv className\u003d\\\"w-24 h-24 bg-blue-600 rounded-3xl flex items-center justify-center shadow-2xl shadow-blue-500/20\\\"\u003e\\n          \u003csvg className\u003d\\\"w-12 h-12 text-white\\\" fill\u003d\\\"none\\\" stroke\u003d\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox\u003d\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"\u003e\\n            \u003cpath strokeLinecap\u003d\\\"round\\\" strokeLinejoin\u003d\\\"round\\\" strokeWidth\u003d{2} d\u003d\\\"M4 16l4.586-4.586a2 2 0 012.828 0L16 16m-2-2l1.586-1.586a2 2 0 012.828 0L20 14m-6-6h.01M6 20h12a2 2 0 002-2V6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z\\\" /\u003e\\n          \u003c/svg\u003e\\n        \u003c/div\u003e\\n        \u003cdiv className\u003d\\\"space-y-2\\\"\u003e\\n          \u003ch1 className\u003d\\\"text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight\\\"\u003eVibePaper AI\u003c/h1\u003e\\n          \u003cp className\u003d\\\"text-slate-400 max-w-xs mx-auto\\\"\u003e\\n            To generate high-quality 4K wallpapers, you need to select a billing-enabled API key.\\n          \u003c/p\u003e\\n        \u003c/div\u003e\\n        \u003cbutton\\n          onClick\u003d{handleSelectKey}\\n          className\u003d\\\"w-full max-w-xs bg-white text-slate-900 font-bold py-4 px-6 rounded-2xl hover:bg-slate-200 transition-colors active:scale-95 transform duration-150\\\"\\n        \u003e\\n          Select API Key\\n        \u003c/button\u003e\\n        \u003ca \\n          href\u003d\\\"https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/billing\\\" \\n          target\u003d\\\"_blank\\\" \\n          rel\u003d\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"\\n          className\u003d\\\"text-sm text-blue-400 underline\\\"\\n        \u003e\\n          Learn about billing\\n        \u003c/a\u003e\\n      \u003c/div\u003e\\n    );\\n  }\\n\\n  return \u003cWallpaperApp /\u003e;\\n};\\n\\nexport default App;\\n\"}]},{\"path\":\"components/WallpaperApp.tsx\",\"generationType\":0,\"isDone\":true,\"description\":\"The primary UI of the wallpaper generator application.\",\"diffs\":[{\"target\":\"\",\"replacement\":\"\\nimport React, { useState, useCallback, useRef } from \u0027react\u0027;\\nimport { AspectRatio, ImageSize, Wallpaper, GenerationState } from \u0027../types\u0027;\\nimport { generateWallpapers } from \u0027../services/geminiService\u0027;\\n\\nconst ASPECT_RATIOS: AspectRatio[] \u003d [\u00271:1\u0027, \u00272:3\u0027, \u00273:2\u0027, \u00273:4\u0027, \u00274:3\u0027, \u00279:16\u0027, \u002716:9\u0027, \u002721:9\u0027];\\nconst IMAGE_SIZES: ImageSize[] \u003d [\u00271K\u0027, \u00272K\u0027, \u00274K\u0027];\\n\\nconst WallpaperApp: React.FC \u003d () \u003d\u003e {\\n  const [vibe, setVibe] \u003d useState(\u0027\u0027);\\n  const [aspectRatio, setAspectRatio] \u003d useState\u003cAspectRatio\u003e(\u00279:16\u0027);\\n  const [imageSize, setImageSize] \u003d useState\u003cImageSize\u003e(\u00271K\u0027);\\n  const [wallpapers, setWallpapers] \u003d useState\u003cWallpaper[]\u003e([]);\\n  const [genState, setGenState] \u003d useState\u003cGenerationState\u003e({ isGenerating: false, error: null, currentProgress: 0 });\\n  const [selectedWallpaper, setSelectedWallpaper] \u003d useState\u003cWallpaper | null\u003e(null);\\n  const [referenceWallpaper, setReferenceWallpaper] \u003d useState\u003cWallpaper | null\u003e(null);\\n\\n  const scrollRef \u003d useRef\u003cHTMLDivElement\u003e(null);\\n\\n  const handleGenerate \u003d async (isRemix: boolean \u003d false) \u003d\u003e {\\n    if (!vibe.trim()) return;\\n\\n    setGenState({ isGenerating: true, error: null, currentProgress: 0 });\\n    \\n    const newWallpapers: Wallpaper[] \u003d [];\\n    const prompt \u003d isRemix \u0026\u0026 referenceWallpaper ? referenceWallpaper.prompt : vibe;\\n    const refImage \u003d isRemix \u0026\u0026 referenceWallpaper ? referenceWallpaper.url : undefined;\\n\\n    try {\\n      // Generate 4 variations\\n      const results \u003d await Promise.all([\\n        generateWallpapers(prompt, aspectRatio, imageSize, refImage),\\n        generateWallpapers(prompt, aspectRatio, imageSize, refImage),\\n        generateWallpapers(prompt, aspectRatio, imageSize, refImage),\\n        generateWallpapers(prompt, aspectRatio, imageSize, refImage),\\n      ]);\\n\\n      const timestamp \u003d Date.now();\\n      results.forEach((url, index) \u003d\u003e {\\n        newWallpapers.push({\\n          id: `${timestamp}-${index}`,\\n          url,\\n          prompt,\\n          aspectRatio,\\n          resolution: imageSize\\n        });\\n      });\\n\\n      setWallpapers(prev \u003d\u003e [...newWallpapers, ...prev]);\\n      setGenState({ isGenerating: false, error: null, currentProgress: 100 });\\n      \\n      // Auto-scroll to results\\n      setTimeout(() \u003d\u003e {\\n        window.scrollTo({ top: 0, behavior: \u0027smooth\u0027 });\\n      }, 100);\\n\\n    } catch (error: any) {\\n      console.error(error);\\n      let errorMessage \u003d \\\"Something went wrong. Please try again.\\\";\\n      if (error?.message?.includes(\\\"Requested entity was not found\\\")) {\\n        errorMessage \u003d \\\"API Key error. Try re-selecting your key.\\\";\\n        // Option to reset key here if needed\\n      }\\n      setGenState({ isGenerating: false, error: errorMessage, currentProgress: 0 });\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleDownload \u003d (wallpaper: Wallpaper) \u003d\u003e {\\n    const link \u003d document.createElement(\u0027a\u0027);\\n    link.href \u003d wallpaper.url;\\n    link.download \u003d `vibepaper-${wallpaper.id}.png`;\\n    document.body.appendChild(link);\\n    link.click();\\n    document.body.removeChild(link);\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleRemix \u003d (wallpaper: Wallpaper) \u003d\u003e {\\n    setReferenceWallpaper(wallpaper);\\n    setSelectedWallpaper(null);\\n    setVibe(wallpaper.prompt);\\n    // Trigger generation with reference\\n    handleGenerate(true);\\n  };\\n\\n  return (\\n    \u003cdiv className\u003d\\\"flex flex-col min-h-screen max-w-lg mx-auto pb-40\\\"\u003e\\n      {/* Header */}\\n      \u003cheader className\u003d\\\"p-6 sticky top-0 z-10 glass mb-6\\\"\u003e\\n        \u003cdiv className\u003d\\\"flex justify-between items-center\\\"\u003e\\n          \u003cdiv\u003e\\n            \u003ch1 className\u003d\\\"text-xl font-bold text-white\\\"\u003eVibePaper\u003c/h1\u003e\\n            \u003cp className\u003d\\\"text-xs text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest font-medium\\\"\u003eAI Generator\u003c/p\u003e\\n          \u003c/div\u003e\\n          {referenceWallpaper \u0026\u0026 (\\n            \u003cdiv className\u003d\\\"flex items-center space-x-2 bg-blue-500/20 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-blue-500/30\\\"\u003e\\n              \u003cspan className\u003d\\\"text-[10px] font-bold text-blue-400\\\"\u003eREMIX MODE\u003c/span\u003e\\n              \u003cbutton onClick\u003d{() \u003d\u003e setReferenceWallpaper(null)} className\u003d\\\"text-blue-400\\\"\u003e\\n                \u003csvg className\u003d\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" fill\u003d\\\"none\\\" stroke\u003d\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox\u003d\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"\u003e\\n                  \u003cpath strokeLinecap\u003d\\\"round\\\" strokeLinejoin\u003d\\\"round\\\" strokeWidth\u003d{2} d\u003d\\\"M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12\\\" /\u003e\\n                \u003c/svg\u003e\\n              \u003c/button\u003e\\n            \u003c/div\u003e\\n          )}\\n        \u003c/div\u003e\\n      \u003c/header\u003e\\n\\n      {/* Main Content: Results Grid */}\\n      \u003cmain className\u003d\\\"px-4 flex-grow\\\"\u003e\\n        {wallpapers.length \u003d\u003d\u003d 0 \u0026\u0026 !genState.isGenerating ? (\\n          \u003cdiv className\u003d\\\"flex flex-col items-center justify-center py-20 text-slate-500 space-y-4\\\"\u003e\\n            \u003cdiv className\u003d\\\"w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-slate-800 flex items-center justify-center\\\"\u003e\\n              \u003csvg className\u003d\\\"w-8 h-8\\\" fill\u003d\\\"none\\\" stroke\u003d\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox\u003d\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"\u003e\\n                \u003cpath strokeLinecap\u003d\\\"round\\\" strokeLinejoin\u003d\\\"round\\\" strokeWidth\u003d{1.5} d\u003d\\\"M4 16l4.586-4.586a2 2 0 012.828 0L16 16m-2-2l1.586-1.586a2 2 0 012.828 0L20 14m-6-6h.01M6 20h12a2 2 0 002-2V6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z\\\" /\u003e\\n              \u003c/svg\u003e\\n            \